=== Test 1: Basic inference ===
identity(42) = 42
identity(3.14) = 3.14
=== Test 2: Two-arg same type ===
max(10, 20) = 20
max(2.71, 3.14) = 3.14
=== Test 3: Inference with add ===
add(15, 27) = 42
add(1.5, 2.5) = 4.0
=== Test 4: Multi-type-param inference ===
first(42, 3.14) = 42
=== Test 5: Turbofish still works ===
max::<int>(5, 3) = 5
=== Test 6: Reuse cached monomorphization ===
max(100, 50) = 100
